1..13
ok 1 - time
ok 2 - now
ok 3 - DateTime from now
ok 4 - DateTime from time
ok 5 - default timezone (utc, zero offset)
ok 6 - date display
ok 7 - date from string
ok 8 - DateTime defaults
ok 9 - date offset
ok 10 - date offset
ok 11 - date negative offset
ok 12 - date negative offset
ok 13 - date increment
